  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Drain and rinse lentils.\n• Cut sweet potato into small chunks.\n• Place sweet potato on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-678d88bfd98f53c0641be503-79feab92.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a medium saucepan over medium-high heat.\n• Cook ginger paste, mild North Indian spice blend, Mumbai spice blend and tomato paste, stirring until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add the water and coconut milk, stirring to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-678d88bfd98f53c0641be503-e7d74ecf.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add lentils to saucepan. Bring to the boil, then reduce heat to medium.\n• Cover with a lid and cook, stirring occasionally, until lentils are softened, 4-6 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-678d88bfd98f53c0641be503-ee8f77bd.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the dhal has 15 minutes remaining, drizzle (or brush) a flatbread with olive oil.\n• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook flatbread until golden and warmed through, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. Repeat with remaining flatbreads and olive oil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-678d88bfd98f53c0641be503-cb740fa3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir roasted sweet potato and baby spinach leaves through dhal. Season to taste. TIP: Add a splash of water to loosen the dhal, if needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-678d88bfd98f53c0641be503-50fc3c8e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice long chilli (if using).\n• Divide Indian sweet potato and lentil dhal between bowls.\n• Top with a dollop of Greek-style yoghurt, sprinkle with chilli and tear over coriander.\n• Serve with flatbreads. Enjoy",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-678d88bfd98f53c0641be503-30da0143.jpeg"
    }
  ]
